        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Yoashi was sugoocheanda Yuda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda Yoashi gaba gweanyeew ispwa damanda ang'eada gheambalmeeda, ng'ata goombaliischi gweanyeew haradam aba Yerusalemu; nea gheawunga ghaamwat geeguura Sibiya bea ng'eanyiida Beer-sheba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwasin Yoashi ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA aba jeeda eawoojiga sean bea ashoohoocheanda siguura Yehoyada. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gageesheesa Yehoyada gadeem iyeenya, aba ng'ata gwayi orjooga ea haweega. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Iing'ata ng'asheesu gagasa Yoashi gabiikta ghwadeas gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghabwada geat ashoohoodiga ea fuga Lawi, ak gwayeesha, “Arita ak gooweayi jeeda mujiinajeega Yuda ak ghoawaamnyi lapiya aba heeda fuga sean bea Israeli gea jea eadeasa gheeda ASEETA gilakweayi; asi alamwaja nea goosisi badiida gadiyeani.” Ak ea masisiina badiida fuga Lawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gaguursa sugoocheanda Yehoyada was siida haweewa saawa, ak gwayeesha, “Ghwasaan ang'iing'i minung' gweadu fuga Lawi aba Yuda ea Yerusalemu gwaadeeda ghayi rugu Musa was siida gadiyeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA ea gea guuyeeda fuga Israeli bea maheemajeanda gichea eabeada?” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba orjooga Adaliya, was gatmooda riing'eeda, ninyarja gheeda ASEETA, nea ea nigadiyeata aba ng'asheega Baali haleanjeeda siikghaydiit bea gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gwarukuta sugoocheanda, aba ng'ata ghwanung' gwasin gweeriida ak geamiinda aba jarooda murdeeda gidaghuuta gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geatayda iita aba ng'eanyiida sean bea Yuda ea Yerusalemu, gideaba gajeeyeadu heeda NG'UTAMIIDA gwaadeeda ghayi iini Musaheeda was siida gadiyeeda bea NG'UTAMIIDA badahuuka fuga Israeli aba dareapcheeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gahoosan fuga hees sea fuga sean ak gweadu gwaadeeda nyaawa jeeda gweeriida bwak ea ghwanyiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea iisinyooh gweadu fuga Lawi gweeriida jeeda heeda fuga hees bea sugoocheanda, hean iissa iidaah gideaba ghwanyiit jeeda lapiyeeda saang'a, hean inyeesa ng'oorshoocheanda sugoocheanda ea siida haw bea ashoohoocheanda haw iissa ghapka ak gageanda gweeriida aba ng'ata goodeelsa heeda abiita. Hean ghoah gida sina eawoojiga sean, ak ghoawaam lapiyeeda saang'a. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghoadaw sugoocheanda sea Yehoyada heeda fuga miineadaysa gadiyeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ghwanung' gagadiiy gearnoodiga deesa gealga ea gea sina beehajeega gabiikta ghwadeas gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, ea fuga gadiyeeda bea gharinga ea lagheanga oomng'i geanung' gabiikta ghwadeas gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gwasin gearnoodiga gadiyeeda nyaawa, ak ghoahiit ak ghoadoabiiwda gheeda ASEETA gawuurji gida ghayi sigasiida, ak gwasin gamajeegiit. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea nihit gadiyeeda, gweadu madeeda sugoocheanda ea Yehoyada lapiyeeda lagaan, ak geesina dabita gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, bea gea gadiyeeda ea gea giidaydeayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida, ea gweerajeega, ea geediga ng'andidi, ea dabita sisna dahaabu ea lapiya. Ng'ata ghoadayda haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi sigwariida aba jeeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA galeagasean aba eawoojiga Yehoyada.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Buuneeda ghaheawa gadiyoojiga Yehoyada",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghawaasiit Yehoyada nea gaba gweanyeeka saang'a, ng'ata ghami, nea gaba gweanyeew bughala ea diktam ea damanamughuush. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata geebung'sa jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi bugusta sugoodiga, aba gideaba nisin gea miyaasiin aba Israeli, ea aba heeda ASEETA ea gheanyi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ning'ata miyeeda Yehoyada ghang'eat fuga hees bea Yuda ak gwasissa mureeda sugoocheanda gooleeysiit ng'asheega nyaawa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean ghwanung'wa heeda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa, ak gagadiiyeesa Asherimu ea sanaamajeega. Ng'ata ghwahidu nyarasta iheenga Yuda ea Yerusalemu aba ramaseanji iteanyaawaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata goojeakta sibanga heanyaawa ghoaghuumu saawa heeda NG'UTAMIIDA; hean geerukusa ng'asheanji ak ea mooleeysiina iita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwahidu guroorooda ASEETA heeda Sakariya was orjeeda Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda; ng'ata ghamiinaada aba madeeda buuneeda, ak gwayeesha, “Gwayi ASEETA, ‘Ghwasaan anda ghoadataschi digheanyeeka NG'UTAMIIDA, ak ea majanyasa nyageadayda? Aba gideaba noojakti NG'UTAMIIDA, eara niny nijaktaneegwa agooga.’” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata gabada ng'asheega munyas aba badaydaanyi, ak hean aba diigheanda sugoocheanda geefuta lagheanga aba seamooda gheeda NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ea mudu ghoapkaat Yoashi doobiiwnata ghayi ahiimsa Yehoyadaheeda was ghweanda Sakariya, hean gwanuus orjeedaanyi. Ak hean damanda miyeadaanyi gwayi, “NG'UTAMIIDA gideabali ghwadaah ng'asheesu ak ghawalda!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Muudeanooda gheambalmeeda Yoashi",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muudeanooda gweayda ghapka shirikareeda Shaamu gang'uchi sea Yoashi. Hean ghapka Yuda ea Yerusalemu, ak gahuuyda fuga hees aba bugusta buuneeda ak gweasa easanga nyaawa heeda sugoocheanda Dameski. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Earapeadi shirikareeda Shaamu hidu nea gweadu fiisu ng'ay, hean ghoahaak NG'UTAMIIDA shirikareeda saang'a jeeda geatinga nyaawa, aba gideaba nijakta NG'UTAMIIDA, was ASEETA ghweaniga nyaawa. Hean gwasissa girgweageeda Yoashi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghang'amwa headaanyi, nea geanung'wa heeda nea gaba deaneaduutka, fugaaschi bea gadiyeeda gabada niny ng'asheega munyas aba badayda foojeanda orjeeda Yehoyada was ashoohoocheanda, ak gwanuuksa badayda bulaliidaanyi. Ng'ata ghami; ak geebung'sa jeeda mujiineeda Dawdi, nea ea meebung'siina jeeda bung'eadinga sugoodiga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Fuga bada ng'asheega munyas aba badaydaanyi Sabadi gil was orjeeda Shimeyati was siida eemeeda Amoni, ea Yehosabadi orjeeda Shimriti bea eemeeda Moabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 24:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea mooneeda diibigaaschi, ea ramooranga wunu headaanyi, ea gea deesta gheeda ASEETA geeng'oorsa jeeda gitaabooda sing'oorsa ng'asheega sugoodiga. Hean ng'ata goombaliischi orjeedaanyi siguura Amasiya aba hoorgeadaanyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.24.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.24.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "next": {
    "id": "2CH.25",
